   "quest": null,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Ragara: We Kamael prefer to punish murderers severely. But now we choose to follow the laws of the continent. Consider yourself lucky that you live in the time and leave here as fast as your legs will carry you -- before I change my mind and show you some of our less savory traditions...",
